@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   物件設計
' chapter:      6-1
' realizes:     UC-05, FR-17
' source:       backend/src/routes/line.routes.js, backend/src/middleware/lineSignature.middleware.js, backend/src/services/line.service.js, backend/src/models/lineBindToken.model.js（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-19
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依一次性 token、raw-body 驗簽與安全改綁路徑重繪
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title LINE帳號綁定循序圖

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "已登入使用者" as User
participant "StudentLineBot" as LinePage
participant "LineController" as LineController
participant "LineService" as LineService
database "LineBindToken model" as BindTokenModel
participant "LINE Platform" as LinePlatform
participant "LineSignatureMiddleware" as Signature
database "User model" as UserModel
participant "LINE Reply API" as ReplyApi

User -> LinePage : 要求 LINE 綁定資訊
LinePage -> LineController : POST /api/v1/line/bind-token\nBearer JWT
LineController -> LineService : generateBindToken(userId)
LineService -> BindTokenModel : create(64 hex token, expiresAt)
BindTokenModel --> LineService : LineBindToken
LineService --> LinePage : 201 token（10 分鐘）
User -> LinePlatform : 在一對一聊天室傳送 token
LinePlatform -> Signature : POST /api/v1/line/webhook\nx-line-signature + raw body
Signature -> Signature : timingSafeEqual(HMAC-SHA256(rawBody))

alt 簽章無效
  Signature --> LinePlatform : 401，不解析事件
else 簽章有效
  Signature -> LineController : handleWebhook(events)
  LineController -> LineService : processWebhookEvents(event)
  LineService -> BindTokenModel : findOne(token) 並即時檢查 expiresAt
  alt token 無效或過期
    LineService -> BindTokenModel : 過期時 deleteOne(token)
    LineService -> ReplyApi : replyMessage(重新取得綁定碼)
  else token 有效
    LineService -> UserModel : updateMany(lineUserId 舊綁定)\n清除舊 activeCourseId／history
    LineService -> UserModel : findByIdAndUpdate(record.userId)\n寫 lineUserId、state=idle
    LineService -> BindTokenModel : deleteOne(token)
    LineService -> ReplyApi : replyMessage(綁定成功)
  end
  ReplyApi --> LinePlatform : 回覆使用者
end

note over Signature,LineService
  群組／多人聊天室事件若沒有可識別的一對一 userId，會在事件分派時拒絕，
  避免以空條件查到其他使用者。綁定成功後 token 立即失效。
end note

@enduml
